{"steam_appid":3404260,"steam_name":"Dead as Disco","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3404260/870164886/3da664872a206dcbf265e3ce7b96fe527ac61d24/1785768310/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785773019","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257391021/6aa4635fe193c95b617b6f2e7b0bb8ccd5117b68/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785773019","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/b4b1afe1ec988fa35b717745e134d0845a572806/ss_b4b1afe1ec988fa35b717745e134d0845a572806.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785773022","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/6604a64cfbcc091134abe6ac0462ad9502f2c2e7/ss_6604a64cfbcc091134abe6ac0462ad9502f2c2e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785773022","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/4d228e082f86b80adb46c322eaea52e7510b617d/ss_4d228e082f86b80adb46c322eaea52e7510b617d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785773022","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/f66faf132aafa29f2c621977307a85643b50367e/ss_f66faf132aafa29f2c621977307a85643b50367e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785773022","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/90026492651e0e8fb790597635cdf86d12d1874b/ss_90026492651e0e8fb790597635cdf86d12d1874b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785773022"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead as Disco</strong> puts you in the shoes of <strong>Charlie Disco</strong>, a fallen icon with one chance to reclaim the spotlight from the <strong>Idols </strong>– Charlie’s ex-bandmates and musical legends. Confront the Idols in stylish combat that syncs to every song, and survive a world torn apart by music, fame, and betrayal In this action-packed, literal Beat ‘Em Up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/18eb6ab6fe17279477146776372058cb.poster.avif?t=1785773022\" width=616 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/18eb6ab6fe17279477146776372058cb.webm?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/18eb6ab6fe17279477146776372058cb.mp4?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/3342b87164b4725cf15f2be57f395237.poster.avif?t=1785773022\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/3342b87164b4725cf15f2be57f395237.webm?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/3342b87164b4725cf15f2be57f395237.mp4?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/2f3853e6aba2013cb89794ad0e662d18.poster.avif?t=1785773022\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/2f3853e6aba2013cb89794ad0e662d18.webm?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/2f3853e6aba2013cb89794ad0e662d18.mp4?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/a8ba88df3b019bd3a893ce9ceca1ccf7.poster.avif?t=1785773022\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/a8ba88df3b019bd3a893ce9ceca1ccf7.webm?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404260/extras/a8ba88df3b019bd3a893ce9ceca1ccf7.mp4?t=1785773022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TO MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, dodge, and take-down enemies in perfect sync with the music. Master the musical path of each Idol to unlock new talents, moves, and dances. The groove isn’t just for the show: it’s your ultimate <strong>Beat Kune Do</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECLAIM THE SPOTLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a handcrafted, non-linear story of reunion, revenge, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in 10 years, the living members of the legendary band,<strong> Dead as Disco</strong>, are reuniting -- for a concert honoring their dead drummer, Charlie Disco. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Charlie Disco, and for one night only, you can have your revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront your ex-bandmates, now the larger-than-life Idols, and uncover the secrets of the past to find out the truth of who really killed Disco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTI-GENRE SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an original OST (streamer-safe), plus licensed bangers from past and present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROCKSTAR CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over-the-top fashion from all the stars in the world of Disco. No matter what look you choose, you’ll always leave an impression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your home away from home, the Dive Bar, by collecting memorabilia from past and present, and in the process unlock the true story of what really happened to the band.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR OWN MUSIC!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play any song in your music library, edit music videos, and craft your own music-synced gameplay spectacle! Dead as Disco is a UGC mosh pit ready for modding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB, AMD Radeon RX 580, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["Brain Jar Games, Inc."],"publishers":["Brain Jar Games, Inc."],"release_date":"5 May, 2026"}